      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Damn it! Daily training... all for naught before\r\nthat massive bulk—no recourse, just done in—!",
        "Jp" : "クソッ！　毎日鍛練を積んできたっていうのに\r\nあの巨体の前になす術もなくやられちまった――！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544718,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Not just me—those old veterans too, cut\r\ndown one after another.\r\nReckon the endless Corruption\r\nDemon battles of late\r\nleft them off their game—",
        "Jp" : "俺だけじゃない、あの叔父貴たちも\r\n次々なぎ倒されちまったんだ\r\nここんところ侵食魔との戦いが続いて\r\n調子が悪かったんだと思うが――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544719,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Hey. You're the only one in this\r\nvillage who can fight now.\r\nThe Tarasque's at <SPOT 922>...\r\nI'm beggin' you — go settle this score!",
        "Jp" : "なぁ、この村で今戦えるのはあんただけだ\r\nタラスクは《<SPOT 922>》にいる――\r\n頼むよ、この無念を晴らしてきてくれ！"
      },
